<%# One choice field in the org colour picker (automatic / one colour / off). DRY: the (long)
    peer-checked swatch look AND the label/radio/span skeleton live ONLY here; otherwise they would
    be duplicated 3x (changing the choice look = 1 place instead of 3).
    IMPORTANT: peer-checked only applies to SIBLINGS of the .peer input -> the swatch div and label
    span must stay direct siblings of the input (all directly inside the <label>).
    Locals:
      value          – radio value ('auto' | palette hex | OrgColor::OFF)
      checked        – whether this field is preselected
      label          – visible text
      bg_hex         – inline background colour (colour swatch) or nil (auto/off carry bg via class)
      swatch_classes – extra classes for auto/off (area + icon centring) or nil
      icon           – bi icon class for auto/off or nil (colours have no icon) %>
<label class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
  <input type="radio" name="org_color" value="<%= value %>" class="sr-only peer" <%= 'checked' if checked %>>
  <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-lg border border-cream-300 <%= swatch_classes %>
              hover:shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#14110c] hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5
              peer-checked:shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#14110c] peer-checked:-translate-x-0.5 peer-checked:-translate-y-0.5 peer-checked:border-ink
              peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-offset-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-ink transition-all"
       <% if bg_hex %>style="background-color: <%= bg_hex %>;"<% end %>>
    <% if icon %><i class="bi <%= icon %> text-xl"></i><% end %>
  </div>
  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-cream-600 peer-checked:text-cream-900 peer-checked:font-bold"><%= label %></span>
</label>
